  "correctValue": "135",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given, Aniline required. is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo> </mo><mi>gms</mi></math></p><p>Molar mass of aniline= <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>93</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Molar mass of Acetanilide = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>135</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>The reaction is given as,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4b74a984-0f31-4998-8d11-98bed419c322.png\" style=\"width: 900px; height: 153px;\"/></p><p>Number of moles=Mass / Molar mass</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mtext>Acetanilide </mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mtext>Aniline </mtext></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>135</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>93</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p>",
